          <div class="mt-auto d-flex align-items-center">
            <div class="bg-primary text-white rounded-circle d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center me-3 fw-bold" style="width:45px; height:45px;">
              MBA
            </div>
            <div>
              <h6 class="fw-bold mb-0">Graduate Alumni</h6>
              <span class="text-muted small">MBA Graduate</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
        <div class="card card-premium p-4 h-100">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
            <div class="text-warning me-2">
              <i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-muted fst-italic mb-4">
            "The Project Management master's program gave me structured methodologies that helped me earn a senior promotion within 6 months of starting."
          </p>
          <div class="mt-auto d-flex align-items-center">
            <div class="bg-secondary text-white rounded-circle d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center me-3 fw-bold" style="width:45px; height:45px;">
              MPM
            </div>
            <div>
              <h6 class="fw-bold mb-0">Project Leader</h6>
              <span class="text-muted small">MPM Student</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
        <div class="card card-premium p-4 h-100">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
            <div class="text-warning me-2">
              <i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-muted fst-italic mb-4">
            "Flexibility and responsive faculty support made online learning smooth. Highly recommended for any working professional in Ethiopia."
          </p>
          <div class="mt-auto d-flex align-items-center">
            <div class="bg-dark text-white rounded-circle d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center me-3 fw-bold" style="width:45px; height:45px;">
              MOL
            </div>
            <div>
              <h6 class="fw-bold mb-0">Executive Manager</h6>
              <span class="text-muted small">MOL Graduate</span>
